FC2: revised 2027 forecast (NYC rates, K-1 60/40 view). Research only, not tax advice. $608,122 book, FIFO, BASE+L1, wash rule applied, pre-tax $, each year an independent replay (no carryforward in).
Rates (approximate, from memory of 2025-26 law): NYC top ST 55.576% LT 38.576% ; NYC upper-middle ST 49.526% LT 29.526%. No SALT limit, no AMT. $3k loss offset valued at the ST rate. K-1 interest income ignored.

